00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.021
-How's everyone doing tonight?

00:00:22.021 --> 00:00:23.722
Worried about your family's
well-being

00:00:23.722 --> 00:00:26.559
because you love them,
but also, you kinda hate them

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:28.361
because they're all somehow
standing in your way,

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.329
no matter what room
you walk into?

00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:32.232
That sounds about right.

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:35.101
In that case,
let's get to the news.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.769
President Trump yesterday said

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:39.072
the coronavirus
economic stimulus package

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:41.641
that was passed by the Senate
was tremendous because,

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:44.710
"A lot of this money goes
to jobs, jobs, jobs

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.713
and families,
families, families."

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.915
I don't know if he was repeating
those words for emphasis

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:52.151
or just having
a stroke, stroke, stroke.

00:00:52.151 --> 00:00:53.786
Senator Mitt Romney
announced this week

00:00:53.786 --> 00:00:56.155
that he has tested negative
for the coronavirus

00:00:56.155 --> 00:00:58.057
and also, charisma.

00:00:58.057 --> 00:01:00.359
Following Senator Mitt Romney's
announcement

00:01:00.359 --> 00:01:02.695
that he tested negative
for the coronavirus,

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.964
President Trump appeared to mock
Romney on Twitter and said,

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:07.066
"This is really great news!

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:09.202
I'm so happy
I can barely speak."

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:11.370
But then, he clarified,
"No seriously.

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:13.472
I can barely speak."

00:01:13.472 --> 00:01:16.141
-Known or suspesked
gang members.

00:01:16.141 --> 00:01:18.277
Advising law markers.

00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:20.713
Will not be tolerighted.

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:22.381
United Schtates.

00:01:22.381 --> 00:01:25.718
-After former Vice President
Joe Biden coughed into his hand

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:27.453
during an interview on Tuesday,

00:01:27.453 --> 00:01:30.590
CNN anchor Jake Tapper showed
him how to cough into his elbow

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.257
before clarifying, "No!

00:01:32.257 --> 00:01:34.861
No, your elbow!

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:36.829
What's wrong with you, dude?!"

00:01:36.829 --> 00:01:39.098
Former Vice President Joe Biden
appeared on "The View"

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:41.567
on Tuesday to discuss
the coronavirus and said,

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:44.904
"We have to take care
of the cure.

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:47.774
That will make the problem
worse, no matter what."

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:49.576
I think he meant
make the problem better,

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:51.177
unless he meant take care
of the cause,

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:53.412
or maybe he meant to appear
on "Good Morning America."

00:01:53.412 --> 00:01:56.715
Sometimes it is, uh,
it's just impossible to tell.

00:01:56.715 --> 00:02:00.186
The New York Post
has published a list

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:02.355
of do's and don'ts
for having sex

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:03.956
during the coronavirus pandemic.

00:02:03.956 --> 00:02:08.026
For example, don't have sex
with anyone who went outside

00:02:08.026 --> 00:02:10.129
to get The New York Post.

00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:13.132
Not even funny headlines
about the Mets right now.

00:02:13.132 --> 00:02:16.068
Grocery stores, like Kroger,
Albertsons, and Walmart,

00:02:16.068 --> 00:02:17.336
have announced
they will begin installing

00:02:17.336 --> 00:02:20.005
plexiglass sneeze guards
at checkout aisles

00:02:20.005 --> 00:02:22.675
due to the coronavirus,
while Whole Foods announced

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:24.711
it's gonna start
charging a cover.

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:29.181
"Not on the list, bro.

00:02:29.181 --> 00:02:31.350
Get your avocado
somewhere else."

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:33.820
A zoo in Missouri has asked
the public to write letters

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:37.256
to its animals while it's closed
for the coronavirus pandemic.

00:02:37.256 --> 00:02:39.792
Said Missourians, "Okay.
I'll get right on that,

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:41.527
as soon as I'm done
working full-time

00:02:41.527 --> 00:02:43.329
while homeschooling my kids."

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:45.264
Mommy, we're hungry.
What are you doing?

00:02:45.264 --> 00:02:48.634
"I'm, uh, writing a letter
to a howler monkey

00:02:48.634 --> 00:02:49.802
who can't read.

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:51.870
So be patient."

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.505
Elementary school teachers
in Missouri --

00:02:53.505 --> 00:02:55.542
big day for Missouri
in the monologue --

00:02:55.542 --> 00:02:56.976
recently drove
through neighborhoods,

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:59.378
waving to their students
after classes were canceled

00:02:59.378 --> 00:03:01.281
due to the
cornonavirus outbreak.

00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:03.015
Or, at least,
that's what they thought,

00:03:03.015 --> 00:03:04.417
until they looked closer.

00:03:06.652 --> 00:03:11.791
Today was Aerosmith lead singer
Steven Tyler's 72nd birthday.

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:13.692
Said people shopping for a gift,

00:03:13.692 --> 00:03:16.896
"What do you get for the man
who wears everything?"

00:03:16.896 --> 00:03:19.131
It's nice to have one
that's not about corona.

00:03:19.131 --> 00:03:21.734
Yesterday was
National Tolkien Reading Day,

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:24.070
so, if you spent the whole day
reading "Lord of the Rings,"

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.071
you're gonna love
[laughing] page 2.

00:03:26.071 --> 00:03:29.274
Ian Morgan goin' hard,

00:03:29.274 --> 00:03:30.843
going hard after Tolkien.

00:03:30.843 --> 00:03:32.545
On his day!, no less.

00:03:32.545 --> 00:03:34.980
Tolkien doesn't [bleep]
on you on your birthday, Ian.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:37.783
Ian can be followed on Twitter.

00:03:37.783 --> 00:03:41.253
It's the worst Twitter handle
of anyone on our writing staff.

00:03:41.253 --> 00:03:43.656
I think it's @TheCh(r)isperer.

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:45.258
I don't know.
We can lower-third it,

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:50.296
if you wanna unload on him
for his Tolkien nonsense.

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:52.731
@TheCh(r)isp--
I don't know. Alright.

00:03:52.731 --> 00:03:54.701
The makers of Peeps
have announced that,

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:56.568
due to the coronavirus pandemic,

00:03:56.568 --> 00:03:58.938
they've been forced
to stop production.

00:03:58.938 --> 00:04:00.373
"This is gonna be hard,"

00:04:00.373 --> 00:04:03.409
