about to eat a Peep.

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:05.878
Ian again, redeeming himself.

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:07.880
Kim Kardashian West
has announced

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.183
that her makeup company
has stopped production

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:12.117
due to the coronavirus pandemic.

00:04:12.117 --> 00:04:15.554
At least, I think that was her?

00:04:15.554 --> 00:04:18.224
And, finally, Netflix
suffered a service outage

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:19.792
throughout parts
of Europe yesterday,

00:04:19.792 --> 00:04:21.560
due to increased
Internet traffic

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:23.929
during the coronavirus
quarantines.

00:04:23.929 --> 00:04:25.197
And so did Pornhub,

00:04:25.197 --> 00:04:27.500
but no one dared
to admit they noticed.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.769
"Oh, did it? Yeah?
And what is that?

00:04:29.769 --> 00:04:31.537
And it's for --
It's for computers?

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:32.705
[mumbling]
No, yeah, I don't know.

00:04:32.705 --> 00:04:34.240
I don't know.

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:36.175
I don't [mumbling]

00:04:36.175 --> 00:04:38.378
I don't know."

00:04:38.378 --> 00:04:40.880
Well,

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:44.050
that's the end
of tonight's monologue.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:46.018
I feel like some of 'em
were pretty good.

00:04:46.018 --> 00:04:47.687
I feel like
we're all pretty beat up

00:04:47.687 --> 00:04:48.888
