my sweater did great today

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:02.535
and I don't know.

00:05:02.535 --> 00:05:03.569
If you're still watching this,

00:05:03.569 --> 00:05:04.937
This is maybe,
now, at this point,

00:05:04.937 --> 00:05:06.672
I'm just seein' how long
you'll watch a YouTube video.

00:05:06.672 --> 00:05:09.141
